       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-PHYSICALITY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-PHYS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DUAL-PHYSICALITY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VISCOELASTIC-RELAX-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COHESION-TENSION-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHYSICAL-CLAY-SEAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-PHYS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PHYS-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PHYS-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PHYSICALITY-AND-YIELD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-COHESION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHYS-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PHYSICALITY-AND-YIELD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-PHYSICALITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RELAX-AND-COHESION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VISCOELASTIC-RELAX-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COHESION-TENSION-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PHYS-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DUAL-PHYSICALITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-VISCOELASTIC-RELAX-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COHESION-TENSION-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PHYSICAL-CLAY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PHYS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PHYS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PHYS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PHYS-CODE.
